7.53L844.5 122.03C844.5 122.03 844.309 121.338 844 121.03C843.691 120.721 842.5 120.53 842.5 120.53L723 156.136" stroke="#646E61" data-v-9de1deb3></path></g></svg></div></section><section class="home__products"><header class="home__products-head"><h2>Build with knowledge</h2><p class="home__products-lead"> Browse the rest of the tools we built to structure the world’s knowledge. </p></header><ul class="card-grid" data-v-24a81f00><!--[--><li class="card-grid__cell" data-v-24a81f00><article class="card" data-v-24a81f00 data-v-1bf66bbc><span class="card__illu" aria-hidden="true" data-v-1bf66bbc><img src="/img/products/extract.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-1bf66bbc></span><h2 class="card__title" data-v-1bf66bbc><a class="card__link" href="/products/extract" data-v-1bf66bbc>Extract a page</a></h2><p class="card__body" data-v-1bf66bbc>Classify and extract structured, opinionated JSON from a single URL without hallucinations. (Surprise! It&#39;s not an LLM)</p></article></li><li class="card-grid__cell" data-v-24a81f00><article class="card" data-v-24a81f00 data-v-1bf66bbc><span class="card__illu" aria-hidden="true" data-v-1bf66bbc><img src="/img/products/crawl.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-1bf66bbc></span><h2 class="card__title" data-v-1bf66bbc><a class="card__link" href="/products/crawl" data-v-1bf66bbc>Crawl every page</a></h2><p class="card__body" data-v-1bf66bbc>Walk an entire site from a single seed URL and extract thousands of pages into a single structured dataset.</p></article></li><li class="card-grid__cell" data-v-24a81f00><article class="card" data-v-24a81f00 data-v-1bf66bbc><span class="card__illu" aria-hidden="true" data-v-1bf66bbc><img src="/img/products/natural-language.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-1bf66bbc></span><h2 class="card__title" data-v-1bf66bbc><a class="card__link" href="/products/natural-language" data-v-1bf66bbc>Structure natural language</a></h2><p class="card__body" data-v-1bf66bbc>Resolve entities, relationships, facts, and sentiment from plain text.</p></article></li><li class="card-grid__cell" data-v-24a81f00><article class="card" data-v-24a81f00 data-v-1bf66bbc><span class="card__illu" aria-hidden="true" data-v-1bf66bbc><img src="/img/products/knowledge-graph.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-1bf66bbc></span><h2 class="card__title" data-v-1bf66bbc><a class="card__link" href="/products/knowledge-graph" data-v-1bf66bbc>Query the Knowledge Graph</a></h2><p class="card__body" data-v-1bf66bbc>Run structured queries against the world&#39;s largest Knowledge Graph of the public web for companies, people, news, and more. </p></article></li><li class="card-grid__cell" data-v-24a81f00><article class="card" data-v-24a81f00 data-v-1bf66bbc><span class="card__illu" aria-hidden="true" data-v-1bf66bbc><img src="/img/products/web-search.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-1bf66bbc></span><h2 class="card__title" data-v-1bf66bbc><a class="card__link" href="/products/web-search" data-v-1bf66bbc>Search the web</a></h2><p class="card__body" data-v-1bf66bbc>Ultra-low latency web search without ads or telemetry. Built for self-hosting and API access.</p></article></li><!--]--></ul></section></article></div></div><!--[--><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><footer class="diffbot-footer font-mono" data-v-ebd946fb><div class="diffbot-footer__col" data-v-ebd946fb><div class="diffbot-footer__main" data-v-ebd946fb><div class="grid grid-cols-[160px_1fr] gap-12 px-6 pt-20 pb-16 max-[860px]:grid-cols-1 max-[860px]:gap-10" data-v-ebd946fb><div class="diffbot-footer-brand" data-v-ebd946fb><img class="h-8 w-auto" src="/Diffbot-Logomark-DarkBG.svg" alt="Diffbot" data-v-ebd946fb></div><nav class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 max-[1280px]:grid-cols-2 max-[520px]:grid-cols-1" data-v-ebd946fb><!--[--><div data-v-ebd946fb><p class="diffbot-footer__heading text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[var(--vp-c-text-1)]" data-v-ebd946